  triad: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 33cc44dd55ee66ff7788990011aa22bb, type: 2}
  prologue: "The fourth pillar stood before a gate of cinders. Beyond it, something
    vast turned in its sleep — not yet the Demon Lord, but his first true room.\n\nAthena
    would not write the ending tonight. Reach the pillar. Leave the next page blank
    on purpose."
  deathLine: Embergate refused Theo. The next page stayed shut.
  tutorialText: Last pillar of this volume.
